{"name": "Piece by Piece", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Piece by Piece</i> is a <i>literal</i> puzzle-platformer where each level is fragmented into jigsaw pieces.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 100 handcrafted levels across 12 puzzle box, Piece by Piece will test even the most hardcore of puzzle solvers with new types of puzzle pieces that combine in puzzles the deeper you get. A cozy art style and an ethereal soundtrack keep you in flow as you solve your way through each puzzle box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/463bb76bda9a3e5c715ab1a342cde411.poster.avif?t=1773671551\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/463bb76bda9a3e5c715ab1a342cde411.webm?t=1773671551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/463bb76bda9a3e5c715ab1a342cde411.mp4?t=1773671551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">12 Puzzle Boxes. 100 Puzzles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 12 puzzle boxes that introduce a new theme and mechanic that changes the way you solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/1d3b97ac4e8f59560640c15edc51101c.poster.avif?t=1773671551\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/1d3b97ac4e8f59560640c15edc51101c.webm?t=1773671551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/1d3b97ac4e8f59560640c15edc51101c.mp4?t=1773671551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Advanced Puzzle Boxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hybrid puzzle boxes combine themes and mechanics into a single level, testing your mastery of each new mechanic. Can you make your way through all 100 levels? Make sure to collect the gold puzzle piece in each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/39d9e25bf20546cd36f3badc5e3f674f.poster.avif?t=1773671551\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/39d9e25bf20546cd36f3badc5e3f674f.webm?t=1773671551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/extras/39d9e25bf20546cd36f3badc5e3f674f.mp4?t=1773671551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Piece by Piece is a literal puzzle platformer where each level is fragmented into puzzle pieces. Clear each puzzle by connecting and unconnecting each piece to make your way through each of our 100 handcrafted levels. Discover new themes and mechanics along the way!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249380/a8df8e0989af29e55a627bba7baf1a0a23d786b2/header.jpg?t=1773671551", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Cozy", "Puzzle Platformer", "Pixel Graphics", "Difficult", "2D"], "developers": "Neon Polygons", "publishers": "Neon Polygons", "release_date": "Mar 13, 2026", "price": "$12.99", "appid": "3249380", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "13 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/eXIJufUz8Fg", "first_seen": 1773356400.0, "review_rank": 976}